# Help
msgid "Help &amp; Quick start"
msgstr ""

msgid "What does this plugin do?"
msgstr ""

msgid "This plugin gives every visitor a unique short code (token), so you can remember form data without putting personal information in URLs. Avoids GDPR issues, ad-blocker problems, and keeps cross-form data consistent."
msgstr ""

msgid "Step 1 - Configure the plugin"
msgstr ""

msgid "Optional: choose a CRM (FluentCRM or ActiveCampaign)."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to integrations page
msgid "Go to %s and enable your form plugin(s)."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to settings page
msgid "Check the %s and adjust retention periods to your liking."
msgstr ""

msgid "Step 2 - Pass the token to your CRM"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: hidden field name
msgid "The plugin automatically adds a hidden field %s to every form. In your form mapping (Fluent Forms / Gravity Forms), connect this field to a custom field in your CRM."
msgstr ""

msgid "With FluentCRM"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: custom field slug, 2: merge tag
msgid "The custom field %1$s is created automatically. In FluentCRM emails you can use the token as %2$s."
msgstr ""

msgid "With ActiveCampaign"
msgstr ""

msgid "Create a custom field (e.g. name: PSFID Token, type: Text). Enter that field's ID on the Integrations page."
msgstr ""

msgid "Step 3 - Email with the token in the link"
msgstr ""

msgid "From your CRM, send follow-up emails with links like:"
msgstr ""

msgid "When the customer clicks the link, the next form is automatically pre-filled with the known data."
msgstr ""

msgid "Step 4 - Display data on pages"
msgstr ""

msgid "Use these shortcodes:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Shortcode"
msgstr ""

msgid "What it does"
msgstr ""

msgid "Shows the first name if known, nothing otherwise."
msgstr ""

msgid "Shows first name, or \"dear customer\" if unknown."
msgstr ""

msgid "Wraps in a different HTML element (default: span)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Just the token string itself."
msgstr ""

msgid "Renders only if the first name is known. Curly braces are replaced with the value."
msgstr ""

