msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr ""

msgid "Does this work across multiple domains?"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: URL parameter format
msgid "Cookies work per domain. Between domains, you pass the token via the URL (%s). You do that via your CRM email."
msgstr ""

msgid "What if a customer clears their cookies?"
msgstr ""

msgid "With the email match fallback enabled, the customer is recognized as soon as they enter their email again. No duplicate records."
msgstr ""

msgid "How long is data retained?"
msgstr ""

msgid "By default 90 days after last activity (configurable). After that, the record is deleted automatically. Manual cleanup can be triggered from the Dashboard."
msgstr ""

msgid "Can I export?"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to tokens page
msgid "Yes. On the %s page you can download per token or everything in one CSV. Useful as backup or when your CRM is temporarily offline."
